9	"On Special functions menu, change Caworkwk get GPF's"
	NOTE - new today with changes to action code
	"GPF indicates ACTIONS.C, line 652, inttok (),PUSHS(G_form..."
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
        The function Caworkwk is accessing F[CF] for a comparison. F[CF]
        is invalid due to the fact that you are on a menu. I assume this
        function used to be run off a field containing the week number.
        You will need to create a form and attach this function to a field 
        on that form.

        If you try to do this in future the system will make 5 short beeps 
        increasing in frequency and there wont be a GPF F[CF] will 
        return the value ""
============================================================================

